<p>Each turn you unleash dark powers through your runeskin.</p><p>For each rune you have a random foe in sight will be hit by a spike of decrepitude, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> frostdusk damage.</p><p>A foe can only be hit by one spike per turn.</p><p>If your life is below 1, the spikes also reduce all damage done by the targets by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 21%.</acronym></p>